["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Hardware/VirtualHardware", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A VirtualHardware is a distinct article related to simulation or emulation hardware.\nThis is used to assist in recording \"Digital Twinning\".\n\nAn FPGA simulation of hardware is a VirtualHardware.\nVirtual hardware requires instantiation involving specific hardware and software.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
