["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/UseAction", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "This is the specific action of product use.\n\nRelationship:\n\nFor each UseAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'performedBy\u2019 on the from and a /Core/Agent class or subclass on the to.\n\nFor each UseAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'affects\u2019 on the from and a /Core/Element class or subclass on the to.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
