["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/PositiveIntegerRange", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "PositiveIntegerRange is a tuple of two positive integers that define a range.\n\"beginIntegerRange\" shall be less than or equal to \"endIntegerRange\".", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
