["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ElementMap", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The class used for implementing mapping a string key to an Element.\n\nEach ElementMap contains a key-value pair which maps the key to its\nassociated Element.\n\nTo implement a dictionary, this class is to be used in a collection with\nunique keys.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
