["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/AssemblyAction", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "AssemblyAction refers to the process of constructing a product by putting together various components. These actions can vary depending on the purpose and requirements. In this context, the assembled product is typically designed to allow for disassembly.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
