["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/SoftwarePurpose/filesystemImage", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "The Element is a file system image that can be written to a disk (or virtual) partition.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
