["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/delegatedTo", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The from Agent is delegating an action to the Agent of the to Relationship (which shall be of type invokedBy), during a LifecycleScopeType (e.g. the to invokedBy Relationship is being done on behalf of from).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/hasSensitivePersonalInformation", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Indicates the presence of sensitive personal data\nor information that allows drawing conclusions about a person's identity.\n\nRelated: useSensitivePersonalInformation in /AI/AIPackage", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
