["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/boundaryParameter", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The boundary parameters define the area or region needed to describe a boundary.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
