["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Build/parameter", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "parameter is a key-value of a build parameter and its value that\nwas provided to the builder for a build instance, according to the buildType.\n\nThis is different from the environment property in that\nthe key and value are provided as command line arguments or\na configuration file to the builder.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
