["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Hardware/centerOfMass", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The mass-center is a fixed property for a given rigid body (e.g. with no slosh or articulation), whereas the center-of-gravity may, in addition, depend upon its orientation in a non-uniform gravitational field.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasConcludedLicense", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "The from Artifact is concluded by the SPDX data creator to be governed by each to /SimpleLicensing/AnyLicenseInfo. If the to of an Artifact's hasConcludedLicense is not the same as the to of its hasDeclaredLicense, a written explanation should be provided in the comment field of the hasConcludedLicense relationship.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/DefinedStateProcess", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "This process is used to determine the state of an affected Element.\nThe DefinedStateProcess is used to define a list of valid states of an affected Element.\n\nA DefinedStateProcess may describe the steps or conditions required to move an entity from one state to another.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
