["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/postOfficeBoxNumber", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "The number that identifies a PO box. A PO box is a box in a post office or other postal service location assigned to an organization where postal items may be kept.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/evaluation", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Evaluation is the judgement, assessment or opinion regarding the compliance of a verification outcome with the expectations of this verification to meet the verification's acceptance criteria.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
