["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/analysis", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Analytical evaluating of data, designs, or processes methodically to verify correctness against standards or expectations. Typical analysis methods are FMEA, FTA, STPA, static analysis for MISRA compliance etc.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
