["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/DefinedType", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The DefinedType class associates a specific type with its defined source.\nIt provides a structured way to represent defined types, holds information about the type's identity and the source specification that defines its structure and semantics.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
